<title>JAPAN: Sony Corp shares jump to record high.</title>
<headline>Sony Corp shares jump to record high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of electronics giant Sony Corp jumped to an all-time high on Tuesday morning, helped by the bullishness in the technology sector, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price briefly went as high as 10,300 yen, breaking the previous record of 10,100 yen marked on June 3. As of 0110 GMT, the shares were 100 yen higher at 10,200.</p>
<p>Turnover of Sony's shares stood at 977,400.</p>
</text>
